ng in sundae gukbap. Popular among both residents and visitors for its rich broth and generous portions."],["Tonshou","restaurant",35.23045,129.08428,"247-10 Geumgang-ro, Geumjeong-gu","11:00–21:00; last order 20:30","","","","r","A popular Japanese-style pork cutlet restaurant near Pusan National University. The menu includes loin, tenderloin, Berkshire K pork cutlets, and katsudon."],["Thursday Party PNU","bar",35.2313,129.0849,"26-1 Geumjeong-ro 20beon-gil, Geumjeong-gu, Busan","18:00–03:00","","","","r","Thursday Party is a popular pub chain in Korea, and the Pusan National University branch is famous among students for its casual atmosphere, cocktails, and affordable beer."]]}